    Domain Entity StudentIdentificationCode
        documentation "This entity holds different identity codes for a student"
    domain entity Student 
        documentation "A reference to the student"
        is part of identity
    descriptor StudentIdentificationSystem
        documentation "A coding scheme that is used for identification and record-keeping purposes by schools, LEAs, SEAs, or other agencies refer to a student."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization representing the context of the student information."
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode
        documentation "A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to an individual by a school, LEA, SEA, or other agency."
        is required
    shared string AssigningOrganizationIdentificationCode
        documentation "the organization code or name assigning the IdentificationCode."
        is optional